{"sections":{"custom_liquid_xwRUpe":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<p><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"> <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Healthy Kindness is the fundraising marketplace powered by Fifth Protocol. Shop with purpose and support nonprofits, schools, teams, and community organizations.\"><link href=\"https:\/\/fonts.googleapis.com\/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&amp;family=Raleway:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><\/p>\n<style>\n.fp-home {\n  --black:        #080e14;\n  --navy:         #0B1F3A;\n  --gold:         #C9A84C;\n  --gold-dark:    #8a6820;\n  --gold-light:   #f0d080;\n  --gold-glow:    rgba(201,168,76,0.15);\n  --gold-border:  rgba(201,168,76,0.3);\n  --text:         #e8edf2;\n  --text-muted:   #9aacbe;\n  --card-bg:      rgba(10,25,42,0.88);\n  --green:        #4caf78;\n  --green-dark:   #2e7d4f;\n  --green-darker: #1a5c35;\n  --green-glow:   rgba(76,175,120,0.15);\n  --green-border: rgba(76,175,120,0.28);\n  --space-xs: 12px;\n  --space-sm: 24px;\n  --space-md: 48px;\n  --space-lg: 80px;\n  --text-xs:   0.85rem;\n  --text-sm:   1.02rem;\n  --text-base: 1.2rem;\n  --text-md:   1.26rem;\n  --text-lg:   clamp(1.7rem, 3.6vw, 2.55rem);\n  --text-hero: clamp(2.6rem, 6.5vw, 5rem);\n}\n\n.fp-home * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody,\n#MainContent,\n.main-content {\n  background: #080e14 !important;\n  color: #e8edf2 !important;\n}\n\n.fp-home { background: var(--black); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.82; overflow-x: hidden; min-height: 100vh; width: 100%; }\n.fp-home a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }\n.fp-home img { display: block; }\n.fp-home .page-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n.fp-home .inner { padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-sm); max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.fp-home .inner-narrow { padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-sm); max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.fp-home .divider { width: 100%; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent); opacity: 0.3; }\n\n\/* EYEBROW *\/\n.fp-home .eyebrow {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-xs);\n  letter-spacing: 0.28em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n.fp-home .eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); flex-shrink: 0; }\n.fp-home .eyebrow.centered { justify-content: center; }\n.fp-home .eyebrow.centered::before { display: none; }\n.fp-home .eyebrow.green { color: var(--green); }\n.fp-home .eyebrow.green::before { background: var(--green); }\n\n\/* HEADINGS *\/\n.fp-home .h2 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 600; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n.fp-home .h2 span { color: var(--gold); }\n.fp-home .h2 span.green { color: var(--green); }\n.fp-home .section-desc { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.9; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 44px; }\n.fp-home .section-desc.centered { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center; }\n\n\/* BUTTONS *\/\n.fp-home .btn {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-xs);\n  font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  border-radius: 3px; padding: 15px 34px; display: inline-block;\n  cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.28s ease, box-shadow 0.28s ease, background 0.28s ease;\n  border: none; line-height: 1; text-decoration: none;\n}\n.fp-home .btn:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--gold); outline-offset: 3px; }\n\n.fp-home .btn,\n.fp-home .btn-primary,\n.fp-home .btn-gold,\n.fp-home .btn-outline,\n.fp-home .btn-dark {\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n}\n\n.fp-home .btn-primary {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-dark), var(--green-darker));\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(46,125,79,0.3);\n}\n.fp-home .btn-primary:hover {\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(46,125,79,0.48);\n}\n\n.fp-home .btn-gold {\n  background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12);\n  color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  border: 2px solid var(--gold);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 22px rgba(201,168,76,0.18);\n}\n.fp-home .btn-gold:hover {\n  background: rgba(201,168,76,0.22);\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;\n  border-color: var(--gold-light);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 36px rgba(201,168,76,0.32);\n}\n\n.fp-home .btn-outline {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  border: 2px solid var(--gold);\n}\n.fp-home .btn-outline:hover {\n  background: rgba(201,168,76,0.14);\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.fp-home .btn-dark {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  color: #ffffff !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff !important;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n}\n.fp-home .btn-dark:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold-border);\n  color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: var(--gold-light) !important;\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n\/* STARFIELD *\/\n.fp-home .hero-glow {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 28%, rgba(76,175,120,0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 80%, rgba(11,31,58,0.5) 0%, transparent 55%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 20%, rgba(201,168,76,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);\n}\n.fp-home .hero-glow::before {\n  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  background-image:\n    radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 7%  9%,  rgba(255,255,255,0.72) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 20% 34%, rgba(255,255,255,0.44) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 36% 68%, rgba(255,255,255,0.36) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 52% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,0.58) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 68% 74%, rgba(255,255,255,0.42) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 80% 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.62) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 90% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,0.48) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 15% 84%, rgba(76,175,120,0.26) 0%, transparent 100%),\n    radial-gradient(1px   1px   at 70% 88%, rgba(201,168,76,0.22) 0%, transparent 100%);\n  animation: twinkle 10s ease infinite alternate;\n}\n@keyframes twinkle  { 0% { opacity: 0.4; } 100% { opacity: 1; } }\n@keyframes floatLogo { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } }\n@keyframes fadeUp   { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n\n\/* HERO *\/\n.fp-home .hero {\n  min-height: 80vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  text-align: center; padding: 96px var(--space-sm) 72px;\n  position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n}\n.fp-home .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 14px; max-width: 740px; }\n.fp-home .hero-logo {\n  width: 170px; height: 170px; object-fit: contain; margin: 0 auto;\n  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(201,168,76,0.3));\n  animation: floatLogo 6s ease-in-out infinite, fadeUp 1s ease both;\n}\n.fp-home .hero h1 {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-hero);\n  font-weight: 700; color: #fff; line-height: 1.12;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em; animation: fadeUp 1s ease both 0.14s;\n}\n.fp-home .hero-sub2 {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(0.86rem, 1.8vw, 1.05rem);\n  letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--gold-light); text-transform: uppercase;\n  animation: fadeUp 1s ease both 0.22s;\n}\n.fp-home .hero-desc {\n  font-size: var(--text-md); line-height: 1.9; color: var(--text-muted);\n  max-width: 620px; animation: fadeUp 1s ease both 0.3s;\n}\n.fp-home .hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; animation: fadeUp 1s ease both 0.4s; }\n\n\/* STEP CARDS (How It Works) *\/\n.fp-home .steps-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.fp-home .step-card {\n  background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--green-border);\n  border-radius: 6px; padding: 30px 24px; text-align: center;\n  transition: transform 0.28s ease, box-shadow 0.28s ease, border-color 0.28s ease;\n}\n.fp-home .step-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--green); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(46,125,79,0.12); }\n.fp-home .step-num {\n  width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-dark), var(--green-darker));\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff;\n  margin: 0 auto 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(46,125,79,0.22);\n}\n.fp-home .step-card h3 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 9px; }\n.fp-home .step-card p { font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.76; color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n\/* PRODUCT CARDS *\/\n.fp-home .products-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }\n.fp-home .product-card {\n  background: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 6px; padding: 28px 22px;\n  position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n  transition: transform 0.28s ease, box-shadow 0.28s ease, border-color 0.28s ease;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n}\n.fp-home .product-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--green), transparent); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.28s ease; }\n.fp-home .product-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0,0,0,0.22); }\n.fp-home .product-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }\n.fp-home .product-card.featured { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.32); }\n.fp-home .product-card.featured::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent); }\n.fp-home .product-card.future { border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.18); border-style: dashed; }\n.fp-home .product-card.future::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-light), transparent); }\n.fp-home .product-badge {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.58rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold); background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.22);\n  border-radius: 20px; padding: 3px 11px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n.fp-home .product-badge.future-badge { color: var(--gold-light); background: rgba(201,168,76,0.06); border-color: rgba(201,168,76,0.16); }\n.fp-home .product-icon { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.fp-home .product-card h3 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 9px; }\n.fp-home .product-card p { font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.76; color: var(--text-muted); }\n.fp-home .section-cta { margin-top: 36px; text-align: center; }\n\n\/* PARTNER FUNDRAISING *\/\n.fp-home .partner-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 38px; }\n.fp-home .partner-pill {\n  background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.92rem; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text);\n  transition: border-color 0.28s ease, transform 0.28s ease;\n}\n.fp-home .partner-pill:hover { border-color: var(--green-border); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n.fp-home .partner-ctas { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n\n\/* ORIGIN STORY *\/\n.fp-home .origin-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.fp-home .origin-inner p { font-size: var(--text-md); line-height: 1.92; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 18px; }\n.fp-home .origin-inner p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n.fp-home .origin-section { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(11,31,58,0.4), transparent); }\n\n\/* PROTOCOL CARDS *\/\n.fp-home .protocols-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }\n.fp-home .protocol-mini {\n  background: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\n  border-radius: 6px; padding: 26px 20px; text-align: center;\n  transition: transform 0.28s ease, border-color 0.28s ease;\n}\n.fp-home .protocol-mini:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--gold-border); }\n.fp-home .protocol-mini-num { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n.fp-home .protocol-mini h3 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n.fp-home .protocol-mini p { font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.72; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }\n.fp-home .protocol-mini a {\n  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold-light); border: 1px solid var(--gold-border); border-radius: 3px; padding: 8px 14px; display: inline-block;\n  transition: background 0.28s ease;\n}\n.fp-home .protocol-mini a:hover { background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); color: #fff; }\n\n\/* LEARNING METHOD *\/\n.fp-home .learning-section { text-align: center; }\n.fp-home .mantra-box {\n  max-width: 760px; margin: 26px auto 0; padding: 26px 28px; text-align: center;\n  background: rgba(10,25,42,0.7); border: 1px solid var(--gold-border); border-radius: 6px;\n}\n.fp-home .mantra-box p { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.1vw, 1.32rem); font-weight: 600; color: #fff; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }\n.fp-home .mantra-box p span { color: var(--gold); }\n\n\/* FINAL CTA *\/\n.fp-home .final-cta {\n  text-align: center; padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-sm);\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(11,31,58,0.45), transparent);\n}\n.fp-home .final-cta h2 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n.fp-home .final-cta h2 span { color: var(--green); }\n.fp-home .final-cta > p { font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.88; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 36px; }\n.fp-home .final-btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }\n\n\/* FOOTER *\/\n.fp-home .footer {\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n  padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-sm);\n  text-align: center; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\n}\n.fp-home .footer-logo { width: 86px; height: 86px; object-fit: contain; opacity: 0.66; margin: 0 auto 14px; }\n.fp-home .footer p { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: var(--text-sm); letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; }\n.fp-home .footer span { color: var(--gold); }\n.fp-home .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 18px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 14px; }\n.fp-home .footer-links a { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.74rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.25s; }\n.fp-home .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n.fp-home .footer-login { margin-top: 16px; }\n.fp-home .footer-login a { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }\n.fp-home .footer-login a:hover { color: var(--gold); }\n\n\/* RESPONSIVE *\/\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .fp-home .hero-glow::before { animation: none; }\n  .fp-home .hero-logo { animation: none; }\n  .fp-home * { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 740px) {\n  .fp-home .hero-cta, .fp-home .final-btns, .fp-home .partner-ctas { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }\n  .fp-home .btn { width: 100%; max-width: 320px; text-align: center; }\n  .fp-home .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  .fp-home { --text-base: 1.13rem; --text-md: 1.19rem; }\n  .fp-home .products-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .fp-home .protocols-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .fp-home .partner-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n}\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .fp-home .protocols-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .fp-home .partner-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"fp-home\">\n<div class=\"page-wrap\">\n\n<!-- 1. HERO --><header class=\"hero\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-glow\"><br><\/div>\n<div class=\"hero-content\">\n<img class=\"hero-logo\" alt=\"Fifth Protocol\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0690\/4522\/3590\/files\/Gemini_Generated_Image_9083dh9083dh9083.png?v=1777674700\">\n<div style=\"animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;\" class=\"eyebrow centered\">Healthy Kindness · Powered by Fifth Protocol<\/div>\n<h1>Support a Cause.<br>Shop With Purpose.<\/h1>\n<p class=\"hero-sub2\">Be True. Live Well.<\/p>\n<p class=\"hero-desc\">Healthy Kindness is the fundraising marketplace powered by Fifth Protocol. Supporters can shop useful products through partner pages while helping nonprofits, schools, teams, churches, clubs, and community organizations raise support.<\/p>\n<div class=\"hero-cta\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"\/collections\/protocol-apothecary\">Shop Healthy Kindness<\/a> <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"\/pages\/community-partners-healthy-kindness\">How Partner Fundraising Works<\/a> <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"\/pages\/five-protocols\">Explore the Five Protocols<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/header>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 2. HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section id=\"how-it-works\">\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow green\">For Supporters<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"h2\">How Your <span class=\"green\">Purchase Helps<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Healthy Kindness gives organizations a reusable fundraising asset. Instead of relying only on one-time events or manual donation pushes, organizations can share a partner page, QR code, or link that supporters can use anytime.<\/p>\n<div class=\"steps-grid\">\n<div class=\"step-card\">\n<div class=\"step-num\">1<\/div>\n<h3>Find or Follow a Partner Page<\/h3>\n<p>Supporters visit a co-branded page for the organization they want to support, usually through a QR code, link, or shared campaign.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"step-card\">\n<div class=\"step-num\">2<\/div>\n<h3>Shop Healthy Kindness<\/h3>\n<p>Supporters shop available Healthy Kindness products and resources connected to wellness, family, daily practice, and community support.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"step-card\">\n<div class=\"step-num\">3<\/div>\n<h3>The Organization Earns<\/h3>\n<p>Qualifying purchases are tracked through the partner system according to active program settings, helping the organization raise support.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 3. HEALTHY KINDNESS MARKETPLACE -->\n<section id=\"marketplace\">\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">The Marketplace<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"h2\">Healthy Kindness <span>Products &amp; Tools<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Healthy Kindness offers ready-to-sell products today, with original Challenge Kits and campaign bundles planned for future launches.<\/p>\n<div class=\"products-grid\">\n<div class=\"product-card featured\">\n<div class=\"product-badge\">Available Now<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-icon\">🛍️<\/div>\n<h3>Ready-to-Sell Marketplace Products<\/h3>\n<p>Current Healthy Kindness products are available now and organized by Protocol category, giving partner pages something practical to share immediately.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-card\">\n<div class=\"product-badge\">Available Now<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-icon\">🌿<\/div>\n<h3>Sea Moss &amp; Wellness Products<\/h3>\n<p>Products connected to daily wellness, ingredient awareness, and practical routines. These are marketplace products, not medical treatments.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-card future\">\n<div class=\"product-badge future-badge\">Future Campaign<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-icon\">📦<\/div>\n<h3>Future Challenge Kits<\/h3>\n<p>Original Healthy Kindness Challenge Kits are planned as future campaign products, including DIY kits, gummies, family bundles, habit trackers, reflection prompts, and timed challenges.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-card future\">\n<div class=\"product-badge future-badge\">Future Resource<\/div>\n<div class=\"product-icon\">📓<\/div>\n<h3>Protocol Tools &amp; Resources<\/h3>\n<p>Future tools, journals, learning resources, books, worksheets, and practice materials may support Fifth Protocol lessons where they naturally fit.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"section-cta\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"\/collections\/protocol-apothecary\">Browse Healthy Kindness<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 4. PARTNER FUNDRAISING -->\n<section id=\"partner-fundraising\">\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow green\">For Organizations<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"h2\">Built for <span class=\"green\">Community Fundraising<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Healthy Kindness is designed for organizations that need a better way to raise support — nonprofits, schools, youth programs, sports teams, churches, clubs, arts programs, music programs, and community groups.<\/p>\n<div class=\"partner-list\">\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Nonprofits<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Schools &amp; PTAs<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Youth Sports Teams<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Churches &amp; Faith Groups<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Arts &amp; Music Programs<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-pill\">Community Organizations<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"partner-ctas\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"\/pages\/contact\">Request a Partner Page<\/a> <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"\/pages\/community-partners-healthy-kindness\">Learn About Partner Fundraising<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 5. ORIGIN STORY -->\n<section id=\"origin\" class=\"origin-section\">\n<div class=\"inner-narrow\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow centered\">Why This Exists<\/div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"h2\">There Had to Be a <span>Better Way<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"origin-inner\">\n<p>Fifth Protocol was inspired by seeing kids and parents standing in the Texas heat selling one-dollar water bottles near traffic to raise money for a youth sports team. The effort was real. The need was real. But the system should have been safer, easier, and more useful.<\/p>\n<p>Healthy Kindness was created to give organizations a modern fundraising asset — a way to share useful products online and in person, connect supporters to a larger mission, and reduce dependence on unsafe or exhausting fundraising methods.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 6. FIFTH PROTOCOL EDUCATION PREVIEW -->\n<section id=\"five-protocols\">\n<div class=\"inner\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">The Bigger Mission<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"h2\">The Five <span>Protocols<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p class=\"section-desc\">Fifth Protocol organizes practical life knowledge into five connected pillars: Body, Mind, Soul, Earth, and Universe. Healthy Kindness helps fund the mission and may provide tools that support learning and practice where they naturally fit.<\/p>\n<div class=\"protocols-grid\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini-num\">Protocol 01<\/div>\n<h3>Body<\/h3>\n<p>Food, movement, sleep, hydration, recovery, and physical literacy.<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/pages\/body\">Enter →<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"protocol-mini\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini-num\">Protocol 02<\/div>\n<h3>Mind<\/h3>\n<p>Attention, thought, emotion, belief, focus, learning, and better decisions.<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/pages\/mind\">Enter →<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"protocol-mini\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini-num\">Protocol 03<\/div>\n<h3>Soul<\/h3>\n<p>Purpose, identity, values, forgiveness, inner honesty, and alignment.<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/pages\/soul\">Enter →<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"protocol-mini\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini-num\">Protocol 04<\/div>\n<h3>Earth<\/h3>\n<p>Soil, food systems, water, air, home environment, nature, and stewardship.<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/pages\/earth\">Enter →<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"protocol-mini\">\n<div class=\"protocol-mini-num\">Protocol 05<\/div>\n<h3>Universe<\/h3>\n<p>Systems thinking, scale, time, cycles, uncertainty, pattern, and responsibility.<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/pages\/universe\">Enter →<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"section-cta\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"\/pages\/five-protocols\">Explore the Five Protocols<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"divider\"><br><\/div>\n\n<!-- 7. LEARNING METHOD -->\n<section id=\"learning-method\" class=\"learning-section\">\n<div class=\"inner-narrow\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow centered\">How Learning Works<\/div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" class=\"h2\">Learning That Becomes <span>Practice<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p class=\"section-desc centered\">Fifth Protocol is not built around passive content. Videos introduce ideas, written lessons build deeper understanding, and practice helps learners apply what they learn in real life.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mantra-box\">\n<p><span>Video opens the door.<\/span> Written lessons build understanding. Practice turns knowledge into <span>alignment.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- 8. FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n<h2>Support a Cause. Get Something Useful.<br>Join a <span>Larger Mission.<\/span>\n<\/h2>\n<p>Shop Healthy Kindness, learn how partner fundraising works, or explore the Five Protocols to understand the education system behind the mission.<\/p>\n<div class=\"final-btns\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"\/collections\/protocol-apothecary\">Shop Healthy Kindness<\/a> <a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"\/pages\/community-partners-healthy-kindness\">Partner Fundraising<\/a> <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"\/pages\/five-protocols\">Explore Five Protocols<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<!-- 9. FOOTER --><footer class=\"footer\"><img class=\"footer-logo\" alt=\"Fifth Protocol\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0690\/4522\/3590\/files\/Gemini_Generated_Image_9083dh9083dh9083.png?v=1777674700\">\n<p>Fifth Protocol · <span>Be True. Live Well.<\/span> · fifthprotocol.org<\/p>\n<div class=\"footer-links\">\n<a href=\"\/\">Home<\/a> <a href=\"\/collections\/protocol-apothecary\">Healthy Kindness<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/community-partners-healthy-kindness\">Partner Fundraising<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/five-protocols\">Five Protocols<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/body\">Body<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/mind\">Mind<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/soul\">Soul<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/earth\">Earth<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/universe\">Universe<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/partner-hub-fifth-protocol\">Partner Hub<\/a> <a href=\"\/pages\/contact\">Contact<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"footer-login\">\n<a href=\"https:\/\/fifthprotocol.goaffpro.com\/login\">Partner Login<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/footer>\n\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"","padding_top":40,"padding_bottom":52}}},"order":["custom_liquid_xwRUpe"]}